    {
      "step_id": 1,
      "title": "Statistical Analysis",
      "instruction": "MatLab [29] was used to perform both logistic regression and the neural network. The ROC analysis was used to compare the sensitivity and specificity [48, 49]. Student’s t test was used for comparison, and P <0.05 was considered significant.",
